synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 169.07, 437.11, 192.07], "text": "Your plan: Ambetter from Fidelis Care Silver. Sent by: Utilization Review (synthetic\nsender).", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 169.07, 437.11, 179.07], "start": 0, "end": 84}, {"bbox": [72.0, 182.07, 108.68, 192.07], "start": 85, "end": 93}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.8", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 201.69, 513.38, 214.69], "text": "Notice of Adverse Benefit Determination — Urgent Pre-Service Request", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 201.69, 513.38, 214.69], "start": 0, "end": 68}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.9", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 227.97, 263.19, 237.97], "text": "Request number: SYN-UR-20261001-0447", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 227.97, 263.19, 237.97], "start": 0, "end": 36}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.10", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 246.97, 271.0, 256.97], "text": "Requested date of service: October 12, 2026", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 246.97, 271.0, 256.97], "start": 0, "end": 43}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.11", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 265.97, 244.29, 275.97], "text": "Provider: Hudson Valley Proton Center", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 265.97, 244.29, 275.97], "start": 0, "end": 37}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.12", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 284.97, 442.19, 307.97], "text": "We have denied the urgent request for proton beam therapy because we consider it\nexperimental or investigational for your condition.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 284.97, 442.19, 294.97], "start": 0, "end": 80}, {"bbox": [72.0, 297.97, 289.31, 307.97], "start": 81, "end": 132}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.13", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 316.97, 369.33, 326.97], "text": "Denial code UM-EXP-02: experimental or investigational treatment.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 316.97, 369.33, 326.97], "start": 0, "end": 65}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.14", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 335.97, 453.27, 358.97], "text": "This decision is based on the exclusion for experimental or investigational treatment in\nthe Exclusions and Limitations section of your Contract.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 335.97, 453.27, 345.97], "start": 0, "end": 88}, {"bbox": [72.0, 348.97, 317.66, 358.97], "start": 89, "end": 145}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.15", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 367.97, 478.89, 390.97], "text": "You may request the diagnosis code and the treatment code for this request, and what each\ncode means, at no cost.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 367.97, 478.89, 377.97], "start": 0, "end": 89}, {"bbox": [72.0, 380.97, 178.17, 390.97], "start": 90, "end": 113}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.16", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 400.18, 168.58, 411.18], "text": "Your appeal rights", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 400.18, 168.58, 411.18], "start": 0, "end": 18}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.17", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 424.27, 442.71, 447.27], "text": "You may file an internal appeal within 180 days after you receive this notice. We will\ndecide a pre-service appeal within 30 days after we receive it.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 424.27, 442.71, 434.27], "start": 0, "end": 86}, {"bbox": [72.0, 437.27, 344.89, 447.27], "start": 87, "end": 150}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.18", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 456.27, 473.3, 479.27], "text": "To start an appeal, write to Utilization Review Appeals, PO Box 0000, Albany, NY 12200. If\nwe uphold this denial, you may ask for an external appeal by an independent reviewer.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 456.27, 473.3, 466.27], "start": 0, "end": 90}, {"bbox": [72.0, 469.27, 454.97, 479.27], "start": 91, "end": 176}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.19", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 488.27, 475.73, 498.27], "text": "For free help, you may contact New York's health insurance consumer assistance program.", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 488.27, 475.73, 498.27], "start": 0, "end": 87}], "kind": "paragraph"}, {"clause_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny#p1.20", "doc_id": "synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 751.66, 233.4, 759.66], "text": "Synthetic · synthetic-denial-fidelis-ny Page 1", "lines": [{"bbox": [72.0, 751.66, 233.4, 759.66], "start": 0, "end": 46}], "kind": "paragraph"}]}